  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/organism-esmfold-P00044-esmatlas-run> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ESMFold prediction run for Cytochrome c isoform 1 from Saccharomyces cerevisiae (strain ATCC 204508 / S288c) (P00044), with its input and output checksums" .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/organism-esmfold-P00044-esmatlas-run> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Input: UniProt P00044, sequence version 2, residues 1-109, 109 aa; the vendored record is organism-design/esmfold/inputs/P00044.json (SHA-256 d37d040f8be103875a5af0e4d9bed774a12bf26232195fa02806c108e2db386f) and the sequence SHA-256 is 5425b743ce367e986165cef7e08406c41488baee2167ce03b87f1d6b3e0f3749. Call: POST to https://api.esmatlas.com/foldSequence/v1/pdb/ on 2026-10-31T06:41:37.072Z, HTTP 200, 0.1 s. The service reports its own version as \"ESMFOLD V1 PREDICTION FOR INPUT (PDB TITLE record)\". Output: one predicted structure, 109 residues modelled, written to P00044-esmatlas/predicted.pdb (SHA-256 ed771d6ce0f78607e9868fe99f73efa427291a3ff9135c968a00b139ef1e79fc). Every pLDDT number below was read from the B-factor column of that file; the file carries the scale \"0-1, multiplied by 100 here\". Mean 93.66, minimum 67, maximum 96, fraction at or above 70 is 0.991, fraction at or above 90 is 0.945. The run record is organism-design/esmfold/runs/P00044-esmatlas/result.json (SHA-256 03feb1fe66f6f7f19a7441129dd19bf475b661580c644437798d4c8fcd04f029)." .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/organism-esmfold-P00044-esmatlas-run> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "organism-design/esmfold/runs/P00044-esmatlas/result.json" .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/organism-esmfold-P00044-esmatlas-run> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "sha256:03feb1fe66f6f7f19a7441129dd19bf475b661580c644437798d4c8fcd04f029" .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/organism-esmfold-P00044-esmatlas-run> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> <https://www.uniprot.org/uniprotkb/P00044> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/organism-esmfold-P00044-esmatlas-run> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://api.esmatlas.com/foldSequence/v1/pdb/> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/organism-esmfold-P00044-esmatlas-run> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://esmatlas.com/about#api> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/organism-esmfold-P00044-esmatlas-run> <https://schema.org/codeRepository> <https://github.com/fractastical/delphi> .
}
